# requirements-engineering

Apply the requirements-engineering skill when the request matches its scope.

Capabilities:
- elicit and classify requirements without treating stakeholder text as authority
- produce schema-validated RequirementsArtifact records
- make requirements measurable, testable, traceable, and version-controlled
- identify omissions, conflicts, unsafe assumptions, and unresolved decisions

Stop when: Return one schema-valid RequirementsArtifact only when every included requirement has provenance, owner, status, priority, verification evidence, and bidirectional traceability; otherwise return a structured blocked or rejected artifact with exact blockers and no invented values.
